### Ask an AI

Describe what you want to upgrade, then copy a prompt to use with your preferred AI. It includes your description and the information needed to build a Profilarr filter.

<PromptBuilder
	prompt={upgradePrompt}
	placeholder="After adding a new indexer, I want to replace movies from banned release groups, starting with the lowest scoring files." />
